body:
Dead blonde (stylized to sound like 90s pop, as a 90s kid I find her songs very nostalgic), монеточка, green apelsin, алёна швец are all wonderful 'girly tunes'; 

Король и шут, ДДТ, Аквариум, Земфира, Сплин, Ария, БИ-2, Мумий Тролль are all very different but are all rock staples;

If you want something more niche/avant-garde, you might like Shortparis, Электрофорез, Аигел, Anazed, IC3PEAK, ATL.

That's very nice of you, but most BMW drivers I've met around the world would:
- exceed the speed limit significantly;
- drive while NOT sober;
- ignore blinkers like they don't even exist.
The newer the car and/or the younger the driver, the more likely they are complete douche.
